<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech c.bank sets limit price for NPF bill auction.</title>
<headline>Czech c.bank sets limit price for NPF bill auction.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank (CNB) said on Tuesday that it had set the limit price for a Dutch style auction of 1.2 billion crowns of 13-week National Property Fund (NPF) bills at 967,000 crowns.</p>
<p>The yield was set at 13.5 percent and the deadline for the auction is 1130 local time (1030 GMT) on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
